{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56051","headline":"与张先辈话别 · 齐己","name":"与张先辈话别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲子同志者，各自话离心。\n及第还全蜀，游方归二林。\n巴江经峡涨，楚野入吴深。\n地日传消息，东西不易寻。\n（同前卷二）（按：《全唐诗》卷八三九收此诗缺五字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}